      "name": { "en": "\"I Grant You Permission To Strike\"", "zh-CN": "「本王允许你进攻」" },
      "description": {
        "en": "When Gilgamesh or Saber attacks, the attack tally increases by 1. After any unit attacks, if the attack tally reaches #5[i], Gilgamesh and Saber launch Joint Follow-Up ATK, dealing Lightning DMG equal to #1[i]% of Gilgamesh's ATK and Wind DMG equal to #2[i]% of Saber's ATK to all enemies, respectively. Then, Gilgamesh gains #3[i] \"Interest.\" Saber regenerates a fixed #4[i] Energy, and the next time she uses Ultimate, the DMG dealt becomes #6[i]% of the original DMG.\nAfter using Joint Follow-Up ATK, resets the attack tally.",
        "zh-CN": "吉尔伽美什或Saber攻击时累计1点攻击计数，任意单位攻击后若累计攻击计数达到#5[i]，吉尔伽美什和Saber发动连携追加攻击，对敌方全体分别造成等同于吉尔伽美什#1[i]%攻击力的雷属性伤害以及Saber#2[i]%攻击力的风属性伤害，随后吉尔伽美什获得#3[i]点【兴致】，Saber固定恢复#4[i]点能量并使自身下一次施放终结技时，造成的伤害为原伤害的#6[i]%。\n施放连携追加攻击后清空累计攻击计数。"
