      "anchor": "Point06",
      "name": { "en": "Epic's Opening", "zh-CN": "史诗的源头" },
      "description": {
        "en": "When Gilgamesh uses Ultimate, gains #3[i] \"Interest.\" When other ally characters use Ultimate, Gilgamesh additionally gains #1[i] \"Interest\" and regenerates a fixed amount of Energy equal to #2[i]% of the Energy consumed this time.",
